MangaDash para Tachimanga

This personal repository filters and redistributes the unmodified MangaDash
extension published by the Keiyoushi project.

Upstream extension code and binaries:
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions
Copyright the respective upstream contributors.
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Added in this repository: the Python synchronization and validation scripts,
tests, personal repository configuration, filtered indexes, documentation,
and GitHub Actions workflow. These additions are also licensed under Apache 2.0.

No upstream extension bytecode or digital signature has been changed.
The signing key in the indexes identifies the upstream binary signer, not
ownership of this personal repository. This project has no official affiliation
with MangaDash, Tachimanga, or Keiyoushi.
